      "url": "https://x.com/QCGov/status/2009243130747629646",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2009243130747629646",
      "text": "Q City Bus Advisory\n\nMagpapatupad ng TEMPORARY REROUTING ang QC Traffic and Transport Management Department (TTMD) para sa Q City Bus Route 8: Quezon City Hall – Muñoz bukas, January 9, 2026, mula 7:00AM hanggang 10:00AM, dahil pansamantalang isasara ang Misamis Street sa Brgy. Sto. Cristo.\n\nNarito ang temporary route:\nAng Q City Bus Route 8 ay dadaan ng Congressional Avenue at kakanan sa Mindanao Avenue.\n\nNarito naman ang mga apektadong bus stop at pansamantalang bus stop ng Q City Bus Route 8:\n\nMga apektadong bus stop:\n\n• Brgy. Ramon Magsaysay Hall\n• Corregidor St. cor. Ilocos Sur St.\n• SM City North EDSA (Quezon City University – San Francisco)\n\nPansamantalang bus stop:\n\nMaaaring bumaba at sumakay ang mga pasahero sa Mindanao Ave., Road 8 at Mindanao Ave., Road 1.\n\nMaraming salamat po sa inyong pang-unawa.",
